TI  - Development and Initial Testing of an Artificial Intelligence-Based Virtual Reality Companion for People Living with Dementia in Long-Term Care
PY  - 2024
T2  - Journal of Clinical Medicine
VL  - 13
IS  - 18
DO  - 10.3390/jcm13185574
