TI  - Effects of Customizable Intelligent VR Shopping Assistant on Shopping for Stress Relief
PY  - 2024
T2  - Proceedings - 2024 IEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality Adjunct, ISMAR-Adjunct 2024
SP  - 304
EP  - 308
DO  - 10.1109/ISMAR-Adjunct64951.2024.00069
