TI  - $xR Exhibit+$: An AI-Enhanced XR Museum Guide based on Constructivism and Connectivism Theories
PY  - 2025
T2  - UbiComp Companion 2025 - Companion of the 2025 ACM International Joint Conference on Pervasive and Ubiquitous Computing
SP  - 1558
