TI  - Cognitive Remodelling and Inclusive Design in VR-AI Hybrid Classrooms for Cross-Cultural Education
PY  - 2025
T2  - 2025 9th International Symposium on Multidisciplinary Studies and Innovative Technologies (ISMSIT)
SP  - 1
EP  - 6
DO  - 10.1109/ISMSIT67332.2025.11268189
