TI  - Generative AI for Context-Aware 3D Object Creation Using Vision-Language Models in Augmented Reality
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and eXtended and Virtual Reality, AIxVR 2025
SP  - 73
EP  - 81
DO  - 10.1109/AIxVR63409.2025.00018
