TI  - Immersive Ethics: AI-Driven Feedback and Virtual Reality Enhance ABET-Aligned Decision-Making in Mechatronic Engineering Undergraduates
PY  - 2025
T2  - 2025 International Symposium on Networks, Computers and Communications (ISNCC)
SP  - 1
