TI  - Leveraging Retrieval-Augmented Generation and Extended Reality for Enhanced Accessibility of Alternative Fuel Vehicle Emergency Response Guides
PY  - 2025
T2  - IISE Annual Conference and Expo 2025, Conference Proceedings
SP  - 936
EP  - 941
